// The Widgie target's Debug settings beyond project.yml. The dev registration secret, with which the simulator
// registers its account against the dev Worker, lives in App/Secrets.xcconfig, which git ignores:
//
//     WIDGIE_DEV_SECRET = <the dev Worker's DEV_REGISTRATION_SECRET>
//
// In an xcconfig value, `//` starts a comment and cuts the value there, so use a secret without it, such as hex
// (`openssl rand -hex 32`). Only a Debug build for the simulator carries the secret (project.yml). Without that
// file, WIDGIE_DEV_SECRET in the environment of xcodebuild does the same.
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
